     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font color=\"#000000\">Mango\r\nSolutions will be delivering a free workshop in Copenhagen on the 26<sup>th</sup>\r\nAugust on R Graphics. The focus of this workshop will be on the use of R to\r\ncreate powerful graphics and is open to any R users who would be interested in\r\nattending.  The details of the workshop are as follows:<u></u><u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><u></u><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\"> </font><u></u></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Title\r\n<b>:              \r\nR Graphics Workshop</b><u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 72pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Specifically, the workshop will cover:<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 72pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt\">        </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">An introduction to R<u></u><u></u></span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 72pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt\">        </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Getting data into R<u></u><u></u></span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 72pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">•     Producing graphics:<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 108pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Traditional Graphics<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 108pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Lattice Graphics<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 108pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">GGplot2<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt;text-indent:36pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt\">       \r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Exporting\r\ngraphics from R<u></u><u></u></span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Where:             \r\n   Radisson Blu Royal Hotel, Copenhagen<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Date:                \r\n    Monday 26th August<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Cost\r\n:               \r\n     FREE<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Time\r\n:              \r\n     6-8pm (arrive from 5.30pm)<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Room:              \r\n    To be confirmed ( but likely to the be Aegget Meeting Room)<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">Bring:               \r\n    A laptop with R installed (preferably latest version) with\r\nthe ggplot2 package installed<u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\">To\r\nregister :          Please email </font><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"Calibri\">trai...@mango-solutions.com</font></u></a><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">\r\nfor a registration form.  <u></u><u></u></font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\r\n\r\n</font></div>"
